      "title": "At the Beach 1",
      "voiceover_lines": [
        {
          "text": "Welcome, little explorers! Today we are going to a sunny place. Can you guess where? That's right \u2014 the beach!",
          "duration_seconds": 6.0,
          "scene_id": null,
          "pause_after": 1.0
        },
        {
          "text": "At the beach, we see the big blue sea. Say 'sea' with me: sss-ee. The letters 'ea' say /ee/. Sea!",
          "duration_seconds": 7.0,
          "scene_id": null,
          "pause_after": 1.0
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's find more beach words. This is a shell. Shell! And here is the warm sand. Sand! Great job!",
          "duration_seconds": 6.0,
          "scene_id": null,
          "pause_after": 1.0
        }
